OL,3,GNEWSABoa constrictor snake found hiding
OL,4,Ain car engine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boa constrictor was spotted hiding
OL,7,Funder a car in Nottingham and police
OL,8,Fwere called to investigate.
OL,10,FOfficers attended an address in
OL,11,FSherwood on Friday after a concerned
OL,12,Fresident saw the four foot long (1.2m)
OL,13,Fsnake slithering down a driveway.
OL,15,FResponse officers opened the bonnet in
OL,16,Ftheir search for the reptile and
OL,17,Fimmediately found it hiding in the
OL,18,Fvehicle's engine bay.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
