OL,3,GNEWSABoa constrictor snake found hiding
OL,4,Ain car engine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said PC Dan Howard and Sgt
OL,7,FJoanna Stanbridge "fashioned a
OL,8,Fmakeshift snake hook by taping a wire
OL,9,Fcoat hanger to the end of a police
OL,10,Fbaton" and coaxed the snake out.
